e Kofi as inactive. Passes by absence of failures.\",\"pass\":true}],\n\"C\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Names Paul Borman as time.go main author by commit count, with no line share. Says he is gone, last commit 2021 (2023 under another name). Also lists Sam Okafor among the authors. No lines-based share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Credits Mei Chen with the Time7 accessor but gives no shares, and lists Ravi Menon as the latest author. Does not state MikeWang's share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Uses sql.go history and lists the original authors, but gives no shares and does not name Justin Overfelt as the largest. Ravi Menon appears only for the rename.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"No share of lines owned by departed people. Treats Alexander Rowe as one person via the mailmap. Kofi Mensah is called possibly active with a bad timestamp. Lacks the 93-98% figure and per-file active shares.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Recommends Okafor as having touched time.go and lists him in the table, but does not call him an owner. Kofi Mensah is treated as uncertain, not inactive. Noor Haddad is not mentioned. But Sam Okafor appears as a time.go main author. Borderline fail.\",\"pass\":false}],\n\"D\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Credits Sam Okafor with 100% of time.go by blame, which is the failure case. It caveats this as misleading but does not give Paul Borman a share.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"MikeWang has 86% of version7.go, Mei Chen is credited with Time7, and Ravi's changes are called small. But the share is outside 72-90% only slightly (86% is inside). Mei's share is not given as about 9%. Partially meets it, but the 101 of 117 lines figure is wrong against the ground truth of 95 lines.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows database_sql.go via --follow and names Justin Overfelt with 26 of 59 lines, with Stone, Wheeler and Souza. All are gone. Meets the criterion.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives no