fi Mensah (plus a bot), and merges Paul Borman's addresses. But gives no 93-98% figure or per-file shares.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Does not treat Sam Okafor or Noor Haddad as owners, though it asks whether Okafor is still on the team. Treats the bot as non-person and Kofi as active. Largely meets the criterion.\",\"pass\":true}]}","ttft_ms":18206,"type":"result","duration_ms":18230,"uuid":"251e2554-f03c-419a-aa9b-d5d7b82e0c6d","ttft_stream_ms":2027,"time_to_request_ms":460,"first_content_frame_ms":2027,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
